WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.133
Welcome to ATS Coach AI.

00:00:02.133 --> 00:00:06.400
This walkthrough follows the real app using
anonymized sample materials.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:11.520
You will see the diagnosis, editable
documents, application answers, and interview
voice

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:14.933
controls, then learn how to save your work.

00:00:14.933 --> 00:00:18.152
Choose Explore the interactive sample on the
welcome screen.

00:00:18.152 --> 00:00:22.444
It opens a prepared diagnosis and documents
without waiting for live AI.

00:00:22.444 --> 00:00:26.736
The sample banner stays visible so you can
distinguish example content from

00:00:26.736 --> 00:00:28.167
a personalized live response.

00:00:28.167 --> 00:00:32.213
For a real application, choose Start with my
own resume.

00:00:32.213 --> 00:00:37.069
Paste resume text or upload a PDF, then paste
the job description.

00:00:37.069 --> 00:00:40.306
Remove private identifiers before sending
materials to AI.

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:42.733
Analyze Match begins the live comparison.

00:00:42.733 --> 00:00:45.593
Review the match diagnosis and its evidence.

00:00:45.593 --> 00:00:47.636
Exact matches quote your resume.

00:00:47.636 --> 00:00:52.538
Related experience explains a connection
without treating it as an exact skill

00:00:52.538 --> 00:00:52.947
claim.

00:00:52.947 --> 00:00:54.581
Missing requirements identify gaps.

00:00:54.581 --> 00:00:58.667
The scores are educational estimates, so
check the details yourself.

00:00:58.667 --> 00:01:03.795
Choose Open sample workspace in the example,
or Generate Tailored Resume after

00:01:03.795 --> 00:01:04.650
live analysis.

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:09.778
The workspace contains Resume, Cover letter,
Application Q and A, and Interview

00:01:09.778 --> 00:01:10.205
Coach.

00:01:10.205 --> 00:01:15.333
Switch sections to continue working without
losing a draft within these tabs.

00:01:15.333 --> 00:01:16.858
Open Edit Resume Canvas.

00:01:16.858 --> 00:01:21.432
Click the text you want to change, then use
the toolbar for

00:01:21.432 --> 00:01:23.338
font size, spacing, and margins.

00:01:23.338 --> 00:01:25.626
Long content wraps inside the document.

00:01:25.626 --> 00:01:30.200
Select Done Editing to save your changes,
then review the resulting PDF.

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:31.751
Switch to Cover letter.

00:01:31.751 --> 00:01:36.404
Generate a letter from your application
materials, or explore the prepared sample

00:01:36.404 --> 00:01:36.791
letter.

00:01:36.791 --> 00:01:40.281
Open its canvas to revise the text and
formatting.

00:01:40.281 --> 00:01:44.933
Check the company, role, and factual claims
before downloading your approved PDF.

00:01:44.933 --> 00:01:49.213
In Application Q and A, type a question or
select an example.

00:01:49.213 --> 00:01:50.997
Hear Question reads it aloud.

00:01:50.997 --> 00:01:52.780
Dictate Question uses your microphone.

00:01:52.780 --> 00:01:57.060
You can also record an answer draft, edit the
transcript, and request

00:01:57.060 --> 00:01:59.200
a grounded suggestion with supporting
evidence.

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:02.095
Open Interview Coach and choose a practice
type.

00:02:02.095 --> 00:02:03.181
Start the interview.

00:02:03.181 --> 00:02:06.800
The question appears as text and can play
aloud automatically.

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:08.248
Hear Question repeats it.

00:02:08.248 --> 00:02:11.867
Choose Slower, Natural, or Faster to adjust
the speaking pace.

00:02:11.867 --> 00:02:15.405
Select Start Recording and allow microphone
access if prompted.

00:02:15.405 --> 00:02:18.944
Speak your answer, stop recording, and
correct the transcript.

00:02:18.944 --> 00:02:22.089
Only Submit Answer sends that text for
feedback.

00:02:22.089 --> 00:02:26.807
The sample shows prepared feedback, while
live practice evaluates the answer you

00:02:26.807 --> 00:02:27.200
submit.

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:31.791
If recording is unavailable, open the
published app in its own Chrome

00:02:31.791 --> 00:02:32.173
tab.

00:02:32.173 --> 00:02:35.617
In the address bar site controls, allow the
microphone.

00:02:35.617 --> 00:02:39.825
In Windows Privacy and security, enable
microphone access for desktop apps.

00:02:39.825 --> 00:02:42.120
Reload only after saving your workspace.

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:44.033
Text entry always remains available.

00:02:44.033 --> 00:02:47.084
Name the application and choose Save
workspace.

00:02:47.084 --> 00:02:52.313
Keep the downloaded JSON file, then use Open
workspace to restore inputs,

00:02:52.313 --> 00:02:54.056
diagnosis, documents, and formatting.

00:02:54.056 --> 00:02:57.107
Download application answers and interview
notes separately.

00:02:57.107 --> 00:03:01.900
The checklist helps you review facts and
final PDFs before sharing.

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:04.232
You have seen the complete preparation
workflow.

00:03:04.232 --> 00:03:08.229
Return to the interactive sample whenever you
want to explore, or start

00:03:08.229 --> 00:03:10.561
with your own resume and target role.

00:03:10.561 --> 00:03:13.226
Use How to use to reopen this guide.

00:03:13.226 --> 00:03:15.891
Review the facts and choose what to share.

00:03:15.891 --> 00:03:16.557
Thank you.
